text:
As with all big communities, certain traditions in your colony developed in a different way. Some people began to see the old ways as no longer valid in the times you're in, and they decided that the future requires your ideology to adapt. As such, {0} has been found.

{1}

Following people decided to join the new ideology:
{2}

translated:
与所有大型社区一样，您所在殖民地的某些传统以不同的方式发展。有些人开始认为旧的方式在你所处的时代不再有效，他们认为未来需要你的意识形态来适应。因此，已找到 {0}。

{1}

以下人员决定加入新意识形态：
{2}

text:
Defenders at {0} have detected a raid from {1} heading towards {2}! 

They are in position to ambush part of the raiding force, that if successful should cause the rest to scatter and return. They estimate the force they will fight is composed of: 
{3}

translated:
{0} 的防御者检测到从 {1} 向 {2} 发起的袭击！ 

他们可以伏击部分突袭部队，如果成功，应该会导致其余部队分散并返回。他们估计他们将要战斗的力量由以下部分组成：
{3}

text:
{1} has recently made a breakthrough in their technological advancements, and they have shared the technology with you.
Technology unlocked:
{0}

translated:
{1} 最近在技术进步方面取得了突破，他们与您分享了该技术。
已解锁技术：
{0}

text:
These androids are suffering from freezing:

{0}
Make sure their clothing is appropriate for the season and that indoor spaces are properly heated.

translated:
这些机器人正遭受着冰冻的困扰：

{0}
确保他们的衣服适合季节，并且室内空间有适当的供暖。

text:
The following androids are suffering from overheating:

{0}
Get them to a cooler area. You can cool down rooms with passive coolers or electrical coolers. Deep underground spaces are also naturally cool, if separated from the outdoors by a door.

translated:
以下机器人出现过热问题：

{0}
将它们转移到凉爽的地方。您可以使用无源冷却器或电冷却器为房间降温。如果用门将地下深处与室外隔开，那么地下深处的空间自然也是凉爽的。

这些机器人电量不足。考虑制作新的反应堆并安排它们更换反应堆。

Android 电量低：

{0}

text:
You are about to remove a geneline that’s used by some of your colonists. Removing it will result in these insectors immediately entering the metapod stage and turning into baseline insectors.
Insector colonists that will be affected:

{0}

translated:
你即将移除一些殖民者使用的基因系。移除它会导致这些昆虫立即进入后足阶段并转变为基线昆虫。
受影响的昆虫殖民者：

{0}

text:
Because {PAWN_nameDef} regained {PAWN_possessive} sanity, {PAWN_pronoun} became rehumanized. {PAWN_objective} Inhumanized trait has been replaced with {0}.

{1}

{PAWN_nameDef} will unfortunately remain forever prone to losing {PAWN_possessive} mind once again, even more so than others. Any negative effects on sanity will be doubled, which might cause {PAWN_nameDef} to become inhumanized again.

translated:
由于 {PAWN_nameDef} 恢复了 {PAWN_possessive} 理智，{PAWN_pronoun} 重新变得人性化。 {PAWN_objective}非人性特征已被{0}取代。

{1}

{PAWN_nameDef}不幸的是仍然永远容易再次失去{PAWN_possessive}心智，甚至比其他人更容易失去心智。任何对理智的负面影响都会加倍，这可能会导致{PAWN_nameDef}再次变得不人道。

